WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.694
At a café, a customer takes a sip of coffee and looks at the receipt.

00:00:07.344 --> 00:00:14.827
Excuse me. I ordered a coffee without sugar, but this one tastes sweet.

00:00:15.477 --> 00:00:21.341
Let me check. You're right, this cup has sugar in it.

00:00:21.991 --> 00:00:25.000
Would you mind making another one?

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:31.854
Of course. I'll make you a fresh coffee without sugar right away.

00:00:32.504 --> 00:00:35.608
What does the customer ask for?
